---
title: How to Duplicate an Invoice Items?
sidebar:
  order: 9
---
**To duplicate an item in an invoice:**

1. **Navigate to Invoices: From the main dashboard, select “Invoices” to see the list of all invoices.**

1. **Select the Invoice: Click on the specific invoice you want to work on to view its details.**

1. **Locate the Item to Duplicate: In the “Items” section, identify the item you want to duplicate.**

1. **Duplicate the Item: Beside the item, there will be a duplicate icon (usually a “copy” symbol or similar). Click this icon to create a copy of the item.**

1. **Verify the Duplicated Item: The item will be duplicated below the original, and you can edit the details as needed.**

**By following these steps, you can easily duplicate any item within an invoice.**
